            <title>1.0.8</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 16:03:59 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>108</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font: -apple-system-body, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
  h3 { font-size: 13px; margin: 14px 0 6px; }
  h3:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  ul { margin: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  p { margin: 6px 0; }
</style>
<ul>
<li>When an app automation is in charge of the fans, the menu bar panel says so once, right under the title, with that app&#x27;s icon. Click it to open the automation.</li>
<li>The profile picker and status line step aside while an automation runs, instead of showing the app&#x27;s name as if it were a profile.</li>
<li>The menu bar panel&#x27;s header now carries MacBreeze&#x27;s own menu bar icon.</li>
<li>After each update, MacBreeze shows what changed, in a window like this one.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
